note Torch lance (tier III): ratios 1..6 -> root, fifth, third: the cloud locks a harmonic-seventh chord (the bluesy one) at C3.
note The flamethrower is a hot recording (-4 dB RMS), so it sits at 0.18 and rides the orb; turn-on fires on lock, turn-off on unlock.

