note Will-o'-wisp (tier I, secret): X n1 p0 . Y n2 p0: both arms on the root, so the colour is all the cloud's: a minor chord an octave
note higher (C4), soft, drenched, swelling with the orb's reach. Almost no fire. Creeps in from score 0.4. No one-shot.
